   {
    "id": "p1",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": [
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": "Grace Haberl was born earlier than expected. She lived in an "
     },
     {
      "t": "gloss",
      "v": "incubator",
      "zh": "恒温箱"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " for the first eleven days of her life. Nearly two decades later, when Grace went to college, she needed to invent something for a "
     },
     {
      "t": "gloss",
      "v": "material science",
      "zh": "材料科学"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " project. She "
     },
     {
      "t": "vocab",
      "v": "immediately",
      "ref": "v-immediately"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " thought of helping early-born babies like her."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "p2",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": [
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": "It is very important for these babies to stay warm. Incubators can help do this. But many hospitals in developing countries do not have enough incubators. As a result, about 140 babies in the world die every day because of low body temperatures."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "p3",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": [
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": "To help solve this problem, Grace invented a special incubator "
     },
     {
      "t": "vocab",
      "v": "blanket",
      "ref": "v-blanket"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " called Warmilu. The name "
     },
     {
      "t": "vocab",
      "v": "stands for",
      "ref": "v-stand-for"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " “Warm I Love You.” These blankets are easy to use. Each one has a special heating "
     },
     {
      "t": "vocab",
      "v": "pack",
      "ref": "v-pack"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " inside that provides warmth. The pack can be reused "
     },
     {
      "t": "vocab",
      "v": "up to",
      "ref": "v-up-to"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " 100 times, making it practical and economical."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "p4",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": [
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": "To date, these special blankets have been sent to 19 countries around the world. They have been used to help more than 37,700 babies stay warm and healthy! Grace’s invention shows how a simple idea can make a big difference and save many lives."
     }
    ]
   }
  ]
 },
